cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MAMUT-routing-TDVRPTW-Lera2026
type: dataset
message: >-
  Cite this metadata for the design and generation of the Lera2026 TDVRPTW benchmark. Also cite Gehring and Homberger for the base instances, Ichoua, Gendreau and Potvin for the travel-speed model, and Dabia et al. for the period structure. Record the exact Git commit used.
